cff-version: 1.2.0
title: HTRogène Medieval Spanish Manuscripts
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it using the
  metadata from this file.
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  HTRogène is an exploratory project funded by Biblissima+, aiming to develop
  generic models for automatic transcription of medieval and early modern
  manuscripts.

  This repository focuses on the Medieval Spanish corpus, providing
  ground-truth data for Handwritten Text Recognition (HTR) and layout
  segmentation.

  The dataset is designed to support the creation of robust and reliable HTR
  models for Spanish manuscripts.
